# This project is a pure client-side SPA (React + Vite) with no backend.
# It does not read any environment variables at build time or runtime,
# so no .env file is required to run `npm install && npm run dev`.
#
# (This file previously listed GEMINI_API_KEY / APP_URL left over from the
# AI Studio project template; they were removed on 2026-08-31 because no
# code in this repository references them.)
